'''Perfect Scabaras''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Path of Scabaras]] [[Tombs of Amascut/Strategies#Challenge room 2|challenge room]] in less than a minute without anyone taking any damage from puzzles, at raid level 150 or above.

==Strategy==
The achievement is best done in a solo encounter while avoiding the pillars room, since this room is a guessing game and can take a while to solve. The last puzzle is incapable of damaging players. A fast way to reattempt the combat achievement is to log out of the raid and start a new raid.

